  "description": "The .docx reader and writer for DocWright: parses WordprocessingML into the document model and writes it back deterministically, keeping markup the model does not represent and reusing relationship ids, so a load-and-save round trip is lossless. Includes Word's 247 built-in table styles. The only DocWright package that depends on DocumentFormat.OpenXml. Most users should install the DocWright package instead, which includes this one.",
